ezc  setup                                                                                                              
╭─ a new store on GitHub ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ This runs:                                                                                                           │
│   ezc setup --new-github o/store --name gene                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ If a tool is missing, setup says how to install it; install it yourself, then run this again.                        │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ y run · esc cancel                                                                                                   │
